---
title: Apple & Date Slices
servings: 12
cook time: 20 minutes
---

Simmer @cooking apples{350%g}(cored and sliced) and @dried dates{100%g}(stoned and chopped) in @water{90%ml} with the rind and juice of a @lemon{1} until soft. Add @ground cinnamon{0.5%tsp} and @ground cloves{}(a generous pinch).

Combine the remaining ingredients: @wholemeal flour{225%g}, @rolled oats{100%g}, and @unrefined brown sugar{75%g}. Press half of this mixture into a buttered #cake tin{30x20%cm}. Cover with the fruit mixture, then sprinkle the remaining crumble on top. Press down lightly.

Bake at 200°C for ~{20%minutes}. Cool in the tin before cutting into slices.
